@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    The staff's work tool: side menu on the left, content on the right, a tighter rhythm
    than the public site.

    The band at the top says openly that access control is missing. Auth is deferred
    (Phase1-Scope.md), and until Identity arrives, anyone who knows the address can open
    these screens. That must be stated on the page, not only in a README.
*@

<a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a>

<div class="admin-shell">
    <AdminNav />

    <div class="admin-main">
        <div class="admin-header">
            <p class="admin-notice" role="status">
                <span aria-hidden="true">&#9888;</span>
                Access control is not in place yet — anyone with the address can view and
                change the data on these screens.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="page" id="content">
            @Body
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@*
    Last net under the error handling: catches what no ViewModel could translate to an
    error code. The text is neutral and never reveals an exception (Conventions.md).
*@
<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    Something went wrong.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
    <span class="dismiss">&#128473;</span>
</div>
